        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget Eliya akïnyorchï Elisya ngoro eghin taman nko odeny par cho kikïrata mchokin. Kimito edö nyo pö taman nko odeny lötunyi. Kïwö Eliya kïrich nyinte, akïngwïs sïrenyi akukanagh puwayi Elisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
