              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpïstö Elisya eghinechi akïrïp akïlenchï, “Pïswante owö oyomis yiyichu nyo pö tagh, atangwïnan nyu arïpinyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
